<!-- End MCK-012: Video Text Wrap --> </td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td><table role="presentation" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" width="640" border="0" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="wrap"><tbody><tr><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF"><!-- Start 1-008: Paragraph | P1 --><section id="1008_p1" layout-row="true"><div layout-row="true"><table layout-row="true" role="presentation" width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF"> <tbody><tr layout-row="true"> <td valign="top" align="left"> <table role="presentation" width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" class="wrap"> <tbody><tr> <td align="left" style="padding: 0px 20px 16px 20px" class="pad20rl match"><p style="font-size: 14px; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; line-height: 150%; margin: 0px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: 0px; text-transform: none; color: #333333; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" enable-personalization="true" data-richtext="p1_text" data-groupid="p1" class="mobile_match"><span style="font-size: 18px; line-height: 150%;">Welcome to the latest edition of <em>The CEO Shortlist</em>, a biweekly newsletter of our best ideas for the C-suite. In this issue, we take up two pressing questions about AI: Are agents earning their keep? And as AI assumes entry-level work, how will the next generation learn? We appreciate the opportunity to connect and hope you find our perspectives useful and thought provoking. You can reach us at <a style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: inherit; background: none; text-decoration: none;" href="https://email.mckinsey.com/T/v710000019f9344d7c494d429f4bbcfb920/a62039a35ac74a7c0000021ef3a0bcd5/a62039a3-5ac7-4a7c-8617-a2cc300cb0f8?__dU__=v0G4RBKTXg2GsTlMa8YbE0npiPHb7Gzq29ujr-mrJsl6bcn0E30HNSquNCCrd1XNAz&__F__=v0fUYvjHMDjRPMSh3tviDHXIoXcPxvDgUU3uRJWe0exHuEi2Hcd3O-Q83ZYiaV8K3MK7Hwke8ldeK2aq3x7m0iOmnOwu5dXydUSRhZIuT9oHkyOTklayJvVHZbnPKd9qG33CXQljvXuvTUrsyKBft9k_UKjPkGAbj12AS4urz_tyveqkAwpenTxowZMUWVtxQPQbAB4Ph0V_HD_nExiRXgEdQepmOnqvFD9l6bEjiTScubQzt_ZoTwuM-nry1Mw5MnEc6sFfkbHRFc2Li_mHFgdofM60iOA3d52M-H6ErZhmjUMSrUjaN_4SwftcqqbFnk52tS1Ll0L38Y9IIUEP33YhiCn59TaOaHxi38qTo1e0qy4VI0qX-UK5lYC84gX2V6gzPCZxRb7Ybq-avq7EfSIzFHDdVksz8ini3-yOkxR6CiNL7zqnnucY9cHiuLJnDpdD-lMp9husmbC3mqUeM-6k3V8sFqSsUb1rVNQewrmuQ=" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-link-id="66465010d51c11f08fbfcfc544639bf0"><span style="text-decoration: underline; line-height: 150%; color: rgb(34, 81, 255);">Alex_Panas@McKinsey.com﻿</span></a>&nbsp;and <span style="text-decoration: underline; line-height: 150%; color: rgb(34, 81, 255);"><a style="color: rgb(34, 81, 255); text-decoration: underline; font-weight: inherit;" href="mailto:Becca_Coggins@McKinsey.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-link-id="66465011d51c11f08fbfcfc544639bf0">Becca_Coggins@McKinsey.com</a></span>. Thank you, as ever.<br></span></p></td> </tr> </tbody></table> </td> </tr> </tbody></table> </div> </section> <!-- End 1-008: Paragraph | P1 --> </td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF"><!-- Start 1-008: Paragraph | P1 --><section id="1008_p1" layout-row="true"><div layout-row="true"><table layout-row="true" role="presentation" width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF"> <tbody><tr layout-row="true"> <td valign="top" align="left"> <table role="presentation" width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" class="wrap"> <tbody><tr> <td align="right" style="padding: 0px 20px 16px 20px" class="pad20rl match"><p style="font-size: 14px; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; line-height: 150%; margin: 0px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: 0px; text-transform: none; color: #333333; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" enable-personalization="true" data-richtext="p1_text" data-groupid="p1" class="mobile_match"><span style="font-size: 18px; line-height: 150%;">—Alex and Becca<br></span></p></td> </tr> </tbody></table> </td> </tr> </tbody></table> </div> </section> <!-- End 1-008: Paragraph | P1 --> </td></tr></tbody></table></td><